w: There Nan-cy's to the* green-**wood gane, To
A3 B (A>Bd) F | TA4 d3 A | B2 (B/c/d)
w: hear the gowd-**spink chatt'-ring, And WIl-lie**
{B}A2 (GF) | (GFTE) D B3 d | A3 B (A>BA) F |
w: he has* fol-**low'd her, To gain her love** by
